=== Other ===
* Tears up [[pill]]s increase tears by 0.35 and tears down pills decrease tears by 0.28.
* The {{tf|Conjoined}} transformation decreases tears by 0.3.
* {{dlc|a}} In co-op, [[Co-op#Special Babies 2|Cry Baby]] will occasionally briefly increase tears. [[Co-op#Special Babies 2|Dark Baby]] will occasionally briefly increase all stats, including tears. [[Co-op#Special Babies 2|Buddy Baby]] will occasionally briefly grant the {{I|Guillotine}} effect, which increases tears.
* {{dlc|a+}} Absorbing an item using {{p|Black Rune|n}} can increase fire rate by 0.5.
* {{p|III - The Empress?}} increases fire rate by 1.5 for the duration of its effect.
* {{p|VII - The Chariot?}} greatly increases fire rate for the duration of its effect.
* {{p|XII - The Hanged Man?}} grants triple shot and reduces fire rate (similar to {{i|The Inner Eye}}) for the duration of its effect.
* {{dlc|r}} Standing near a {{e|White Poop|n}} or [[Familiar#Dips|White Dip]] will greatly increase fire rate.
* {{dlc|r}} Standing on brown creep produced by {{i|IBS|n}} or {{c|Tainted ???}} will increase fire rate by 1.5.
* {{p|Soul of Samson}} activates the {{i|Berserk!|n}} effect, which increases tears.
* {{dlc+|r}} {{c|Judas}} + {{i|The Book of Belial}} + {{i|Birthright}} + {{i|Decap Attack}}: Grants Judas ×3 fire rate while his head is detached from his body.{{dlc-}}

